==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*10 [[Pumpkin Doge]]s (400%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Vlad de Sable]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Vlad de Sable]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Vlad de Sable]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Helmut Krabbe]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Count Owlbrow]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Pumpkin Doge]]s (100%) spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Christmas D.|Christmas Ds]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**3 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
In this level, you can mainly rely on [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-alien units]] such as [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Wheel Cat]], or [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Surfer Cat]]. This is to easily kill off the Helmut Krabbes and Hyppohs assuming all [[Treasure]]s from [[Into the Future]].


Pumpkin Doges and Shibaliens are easy to kill off, and they won't disturb your meatshielding process. Once you save enough, deploy a [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] to easily deal with the Count Olwbrows and Vlad de Sables. If you have any [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-floating units]], such as [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Shaman Cat]] or [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Bishop Cat]], they will not push as much. If you obtained Awakened Bahamut, his efficiency against the Christmas Ds will be much easier.


This level mainly relies on patience and cooperation, but eventually, you will successfully beat the level.

